                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29bd7735-3211-446f-b2f2-94c27c8bc5cb",
                                                "sense_id": "58bd67bd-3fa3-3ece-9e17-f5eaab699b2b",
                                                "text": "\"Well,\" she grinned, looking hot and sexy. \"They say you doing some real nasty shit in the NBA, but on the mic you a little too competitive. They say you a gaming niggah who likes to keep up all kinds of go-to-war gangsta friction between rappers. That shit must work for you though, huh? You stickin' all over the charts when other artists are failin' off. They rotating your cuts on the radio like mad too.\""
